{"id":"steam-764710","steam":764710,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"WARPSQUAD","summary":"WARPSQUAD is a space exploration rogue-lite in an ever-changing galaxy to be played solo or co-op. Encounter a wide range of hostile spaceships, special events, and upgrades to your ship and crew. Master the ship terminals and crew with unique traits to survive this hostile world.","about":"WARPSQUAD is a space exploration rogue-lite in an ever-changing galaxy to be played solo or co-op. Encounter a wide range of hostile spaceships, special events, and upgrades to your ship and crew. Master the ship terminals and crew with unique traits to survive this hostile world.\r\n\r\nTake control of a spaceship crew and explore the universe, upgrading your ship and crew in preparation for the final battle.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\n• Take control of a spaceship and crew, alone or with a friend.\r\n• Navigate an ever-changing path to victory full of danger and opportunity.\r\n• Upgrade your ship and crew with a unique and large set of Ship Augments & Crew Mutations.\r\n• Optimize your strategy against a wide range of combat encounters.\r\n• Make important decisions through text-based Events and in-world Scenarios that have a deep-influence on your playthrough.\r\n• Real-time with Pause lets you take a break from the chaos to re-plan your strategy in combat.\r\n• Death is permanent, and each playthrough is unique with procedural encounters and events.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764710/library_600x900.jpg?t=1739086644","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764710/header.jpg?t=1739086644","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764710/library_hero.jpg?t=1739086644","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764710/header.jpg?t=1739086644","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764710/page